<br />
Saturday will be the Ry'gorr Fortress for 30+, raiding for Ry'gorr Armor drops and Orc Fang Earrings/Necklaces for those on raid and for the guild bank. 7PM GMT and 7PM PST<br />
<br />
Sunday will be Lower Guk for 40+, raiding for whatever of the good drops are open for those on raid and guild bank. 7PM GMT and 7PM PST<br />
<br />
In addition, I would like to make arrangements for our mid to high levels to form regular RM HG hunting parties to build up the guild bank.
